.TH QUIPU-REPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-report \- Report hubs, surprising links and open questions in the graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu report\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-predicate\fR] [\fB\-\-hubs\fR] [\fB\-\-surprises\fR] [\fB\-\-questions\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report hubs, surprising links and open questions in the graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-predicate\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-hubs\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-surprises\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-questions\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
